(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-32","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["实验楼门口写着二百二十[[volt|伏特]]，提醒我这里的[[reality|实际]]与好看的宣传不同。学生为志愿项目[[enroll|加入]]，教室讲[[molecule|分子]]，院外供水够人[[bathe|洗澡]]。一位[[workman|工匠]]在修窗，[[sophisticated|精密的]]仪器不妨碍窗框漏雨。[[sunrise|日出]]时送来的样品仍封好，程雾给记录器换[[battery|电池]]，检查路上有没有[[accident|意外]]。接收老师先核编号与封签，再让我们进门。我没问什么时候能给出让人安心的答案，先问这两只瓶子是否仍是昨天在两处取下来的那两只。","基金代表来[[promote|宣传]]合作，老师只做[[routine|常规的]]接收，没把我们的追问看作[[attack|攻击]]。老陈用[[humour|幽默]]说好瓶也怕换帽；老师说不能把检测与来源[[divorce|分离]]。捐款可有不同[[currency|货币]]，样品却不能随便换号。她将封签照[[attach|附在]]记录上，见我[[ankle|脚踝]]肿了，让我坐着；昨晚我没注意的小伤，在这里终于被发现。基金代表提议办一场知识[[quiz|问答赛]]，让孩子[[participate|参加]]。老师答应日后另安排，今天先把现实里已经出了问题的水样保存好。","仓库仍有[[surplus|多余的]]旧瓶，导师[[correspondence|信件]]说仅用于教学。一名[[reporter|记者]]想[[disclose|披露]]检测结果，我说还没完成。她谈慈善像[[religion|宗教]]，老师说别让焦虑成为[[torture|折磨]]受助者的东西。[[purple|紫色]]封签那瓶与白签地点不同，助手正准备[[quit|离开]]去上课，先把两者分清。我看见校园[[prosperous|繁荣的]]角落来自真实投入，记录的[[fashion|方式]]仍要一致。程雾记下冷藏位置和移交时间，不去拍那些并未同意出现在新闻里的孩子，镜头的方便不能优先于他们的普通日子。","代表的讲稿[[preface|序言]]称水源恢复，老师打开记录箱[[lid|盖子]]，拒绝提前签结果。手续[[tedious|冗长乏味]]，却使[[donation|捐赠物]]不能变成样品的身份。基金声势[[immense|巨大]]，[[given|考虑到]]疑点，老师要求[[definite|明确的]]批次来源，不说这将是[[ultimate|最终的]]检测。[[campus|校园]]实验室只能承担约定的分析，叶澄必须[[adapt|适应]]这一限制。她没有像刚来档案站时那样把沉默当拒绝，只坐在桌边写出自己确知的物料名称，未知处留白，这份不完整的清单比宣传册完整的故事有用。","孩子们走过门口很[[cheerful|快乐]]，我怕他们[[misunderstand|误解]]今天的来访。老师从[[overall|整体的]]路径说明工作，不能[[assume|假定]]颜色就是危险。她用[[plural|复数的]]‘样品’指出我们查的是两条来源，不是一个装满答案的瓶。[[doctoral|博士的]]研究员过去参与工程，这次回避具体检测，由另一人承担[[effort|工作]]。接收[[video|录像]]保留了更换责任人的过程。没有必要制造[[disaster|灾难]]预言，也别把结果当攻击人的[[weapon|武器]]。叶澄听完说她会把这些话带给工人，而不是再让他们相信签过字就代表什么都检查过。","老师确认两瓶来自约定地点，仪器分析需时间。我们拿到正式接收回执，没有拿到一份可以立即宣布有害或无害的报告。何警官安排人员留意原厂交接记录，程雾则先去核水声发生的时段。老陈说我的脚比他的肘更该休息，便把晚上跑旧院的任务交给巡查员，我们只查图。叶澄发来当年设备清单：其中一种处理筒原属停产旧厂，曾与B-17同车出港。样品瓶现在安稳留在校园，人的路却必须往回走，到那件设备最初被宣布停用的地方去。"],"en":["A 220-[[volt|volt]] notice marked a [[reality|reality]] beyond publicity. Students could [[enroll|enroll]] in aid work, study a [[molecule|molecule]], and have water to [[bathe|bathe]]. A [[workman|workman]] repaired leaking windows beside [[sophisticated|sophisticated]] instruments. Samples arriving at [[sunrise|sunrise]] remained sealed. Cheng changed a recorder [[battery|battery]] and checked for transport [[accident|accidents]]. The receiving teacher verified seals first. I asked whether these remained yesterday's two bottles, before asking for reassuring answers.","A fund representative would [[promote|promote]] collaboration; the teacher performed [[routine|routine]] receipt, accepting questions as no [[attack|attack]]. Chen's [[humour|humour]] concerned exchanged caps. Testing could not [[divorce|divorce]] results from origins. Donations used different [[currency|currencies]], samples retained numbers. She would [[attach|attach]] seal photographs, then seat me for a swollen [[ankle|ankle]]. A proposed [[quiz|quiz]] for children to [[participate|participate]] could wait. Actual disputed water took priority today.","[[surplus|Surplus]] bottles served teaching, said a supervisor's [[correspondence|correspondence]]. A [[reporter|reporter]] sought to [[disclose|disclose]] unfinished results. She compared charity to [[religion|religion]]; anxiety should not [[torture|torture]] recipients, the teacher said. Before assistants could [[quit|quit]] for class, they distinguished [[purple|purple]] and white location seals. A [[prosperous|prosperous]] campus owed real investment, yet documentation [[fashion|fashion]] must remain consistent. Cheng recorded storage and transfers without filming unconsenting children.","The representative's [[preface|preface]] claimed restored water. Opening a box [[lid|lid]], the teacher rejected premature results. [[tedious|Tedious]] procedures prevented [[donation|donation]] from becoming sample identity. [[given|Given]] doubts despite [[immense|immense]] fund influence, she required [[definite|definite]] origins and promised no [[ultimate|ultimate]] test. The [[campus|campus]] laboratory had limits; Ye must [[adapt|adapt]]. She now wrote known materials and left unknowns blank. This incomplete list was more useful than complete promotional stories.","[[cheerful|Cheerful]] children passed; I feared they might [[misunderstand|misunderstand]]. Explaining the [[overall|overall]] pathway, the teacher would not [[assume|assume]] color meant danger. The [[plural|plural]] 'samples' meant separate origins. A [[doctoral|doctoral]] researcher formerly involved in engineering stepped aside; another undertook the [[effort|effort]]. Receipt [[video|video]] retained that change. No [[disaster|disaster]] prophecy was needed, nor results as a [[weapon|weapon]]. Ye would tell workers that signatures did not mean every component had been tested.","We received formal custody receipts, not immediate safety conclusions. He arranged checks on factory handover records; Cheng would compare sound times. Chen insisted my ankle needed rest as much as his elbow. Inspectors would visit the yard; we would compare plans. Ye sent a list identifying a treatment cylinder from the closed factory, once shipped with B-17. The bottles stayed secure on campus. Our path must run backward to where that equipment was first declared retired."]});
